<title>CHINA: China rice exports soar in Jan-Aug from year-ago.</title>
<headline>China rice exports soar in Jan-Aug from year-ago.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's rice exports reached 150,000 tonnes in the first eight months of 1996, up nearly 470 percent on the same year-ago period, customs figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Rice exports in August alone were 60,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>But China's rice imports slumped 69 percent to 430,000 tonnes in the first eight months, down from 1.39 million tonnes in the same year-ago period, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Imports in August alone were 40,000 tonnes.</p>
</text>
